301
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:53,260
Something like, that's an interesting point, but I'm afraid we don't have time to talk about that in today's meeting.

302
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:56,140
Perhaps we can add that onto the agenda for next week.

303
00:13:56,620 --> 00:14:02,950
Ah, so you acknowledge the point, validate it by suggesting a future time, but firmly bring the focus back.

304
00:14:03,370 --> 00:14:03,750
Clever.

305
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:04,520
Exactly.

306
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:08,220
Keeps things on track without dismissing the idea entirely.

307
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,640
OK, fantastic.

308
00:14:10,210 --> 00:14:12,610
